{"id":"edbd4c995aabf094","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dnftaut.md","title":"DNF tautology is coNP-complete","display":"thm-dnftaut — DNF tautology is coNP-complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dnftaut","aliases":["27-thm-dnftaut"],"display":"thm-dnftaut — DNF tautology is coNP-complete","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-constfunc]]","[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-conpcomplete]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.2 Theorem 2.1; Appendix B.6","source_printed_pages":"73–74, 621","source_pdf_pages":"97–98, 645","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-via-complement"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dnftaut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dnftaut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnftaut — DNF tautology is coNP-complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43077da4ca08cb6c\" href=\"?note=43077da4ca08cb6c\" title=\"27-df-conpcomplete\">27-df-conpcomplete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.2 Theorem 2.1; Appendix B.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"73–74, 621"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"97–98, 645"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-via-complement"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_n\">\\(\\mathbf1_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>，显式编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNPC}\">\\(\\mathbf{coNPC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"43077da4ca08cb6c\" href=\"?note=43077da4ca08cb6c\" title=\"27-df-conpcomplete\">27-df-conpcomplete</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\)</span> 为下式定义的二进制语言符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=\\mathbf1_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=\\mathbf1_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>合法码上的反问题是 DNF 零方程的一致性（NP-complete）；非法码能多项式识别并按 No-instance 处理，所以补语言仍在 NP。NP-hardness 的来源归约只输出合法 DNF 码。核对陈述和输入格式，不声称重审 Cook 定理全证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-constfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conpcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"43077da4ca08cb6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-conpcomplete]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]，显式编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\mathbf{coNPC}$ 见 [[27-df-conpcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]，显式编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\mathbf{coNPC}$ 见 [[27-df-conpcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]，显式编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\mathbf{coNPC}$ 见 [[27-df-conpcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conpcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"43077da4ca08cb6c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathbf1_n$ 见 [[27-df-constfunc]]，显式编码见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\mathbf{coNPC}$ 见 [[27-df-conpcomplete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}$ 为下式定义的二进制语言符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=\\mathbf1_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNFTAUT}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.","display":true}],"bytes":1549,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-dnftaut|thm-dnftaut — DNF tautology is coNP-complete]]"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","35eab4f22873ea23","42004383fb23d1fe","43077da4ca08cb6c"]}